<section class="section paper" id="who-not-for">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow"><span>⚠️</span> FULL TRANSPARENCY</p>
    <h2>Who Clean Rows is NOT for</h2>
    <p>We are a bespoke data boutique, not a bulk database dump. If you fall into any of these categories, we are proudly not the right fit for you.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="result-grid" style="margin-top: 2rem;">
    <article class="result-card" style="border-top: 4px solid var(--ink);">
      <h3>The "Quantity over Quality" buyer</h3>
      <p>If you just want 1,000,000 random emails to blast from a burner domain for $5, we cannot help you. We focus on high-ticket, highly targeted outreach.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="result-card" style="border-top: 4px solid var(--ink);">
      <h3>The "B2C / Consumer" marketer</h3>
      <p>We do not source, scrape, or sell consumer data, personal emails (like Gmail/Yahoo), or physical home addresses. Strictly B2B.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="result-card" style="border-top: 4px solid var(--ink);">
      <h3>The "Instant Export" seeker</h3>
      <p>We build lists fresh to order. If you cannot wait 24 hours for a human-verified, clean file and need an instant, unverified download, use a software tool.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
